{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00745","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉荐有典，至诚莫骞。\n画梁云亘，雕俎星连。\n乐器周列，礼容备宣。\n依稀如在，若未宾天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}